<title>GERMANY: Buba says Feb min reserve requirement 39.4 bln dmk.</title>
<headline>Buba says Feb min reserve requirement 39.4 bln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The preliminary minimum reserve requirement for German banks for February is 39.4 billion marks, the Bundesbank announced on Monday.</p>
<p>The figure was below what banks held with the Bundesbank so far during the month. As of February 21, banks held 41.7 billion marks.</p>
<p>The average for the month through February 23 stood at 40.3 billion marks. --Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
